          "prompt": "1.2::artist:belko,artist:yamamoto_souichirou::,0.8::tianliang duohe fangdongye,mistel_(sukebemistel),betanonbeet::,artist:yalmyu,0.8::artist:villainchin,artist:mizu_asato::,0.6::artist:betabeet::,0.2::artist:rhasta::,artist:moromoro_0p0, artist:sh_(shinh),0.8::artist:machi (machi0910),artist:smilesmile1312,::,0.8::artist:dayama::,artist:bacheally,-2::artist collaboration::,year2024,year 2025,ultra-detailed,::simple background,white background,colored lineart,2::lineart, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text",
          "description": "",
