        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0045",
          "alias": "社区精选 045",
          "prompt": "<artist>\nartist:smilesmile1312,healthyman,fenrir (fenriluuu),,0.8::artist:kanzarin::,0.5::bacheally::,artist:sh_(shinh),shio (shiofeifei)\n</artist>\n\n<style>\nyear 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,4::cute::\n</style>\n\n<artwork>\n  <rendering_and_art_style>\n    Masterpiece anime illustration with 35mm photographic aesthetic, organic lineart (#4A382D), rich volumetric shading, and delicate filmic tonal roll-off. Soft analog texture, realistic optical depth-of-field.\n  </rendering_and_art_style>\n\n  <color_system>\n    Natural high-contrast palette: warm golden sunlight (#FFF0D0, #FCD59A) balanced against cool ambient foliage shadows (#2A3D34, #6C8299). Periwinkle blue (#CAD5F7), oatmeal cream (#F4E2C7), and crimson (#D62839).\n  </color_system>\n\n  <camera_and_composition bbox=\"[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\">\n    High-angle view looking down at a 45-degree angle. 35mm prime lens perspective, shallow depth of field with creamy natural background bokeh and soft optical falloff at the perimeter.\n  </camera_and_composition>\n\n  <lighting_and_atmosphere>\n    Natural directional afternoon sunlight filtering through leaves, creating clear yet soft-edged chiaroscuro cast shadows across the ground and garments. Delicate rim lighting (#FFF5E0) outlining hair flyaways, subtle organic highlight halation without artificial rainbow flares. Realistic soft ambient light bounce.\n  </lighting_and_atmosphere>\n\n  <character_and_anatomy bbox=\"[120, 160, 920, 840]\">\n    <identity>\n      Neuro-sama, petite anime girl VTuber, signature twintails with ahoge and red ribbons.\n    </identity>\n    \n    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox=\"[180, 330, 480, 630]\">\n      Looking up toward the viewer with a sweet, lively smile. Large translucent turquoise eyes (#4A9BAE, #5BC0BE) capturing crisp natural sky catchlights. Subtle cheek blush with natural skin translucency.\n    </facial_structure_and_expression>\n\n    <hair_architecture>\n      Light chestnut brown hair (#B59A83, deep shadow #6E5341) styled into twin tails with vivid crimson red ribbons (#D62839). Distinct curved ahoge antenna [120, 470, 180, 520] on crown. Silver heart hairclip (#E8E8E8) on bangs. Fine backlit flyaway strands.\n    </hair_architecture>\n\n    <pose_and_biomechanics>\n      Seated casually on a sun-drenched wooden garden bench or picnic blanket, leaning slightly forward with one hand resting on her knee, gazing up curiously at the camera.\n    </pose_and_biomechanics>\n\n    <attire_and_materials>\n      Cozy oatmeal-beige knit cardigan (#F4E2C7) showing realistic yarn weave and soft shadow folds, decorated with novelty pins (pink '1' badge, purple heart, silver drone pin, star, green turtle badge). Worn over a pale periwinkle sailor collar shirt (#D0D8F5) with mint-teal ribbon tie (#2EC4B6) and pleated skirt (#CAD5F7).\n    </attire_and_materials>\n  </character_and_anatomy>\n\n  <environment_and_scenery>\n    Peaceful garden terrace or park with warm weathered wooden deck boards and dappled leafy shadows. A small glass of iced drink with lemon slices, scattered fallen petals, and a cute green plush turtle mascot resting in the warm sunlight beside her. Creamy out-of-focus garden greenery in background.\n  </environment_and_scenery>\n</artwork>, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text, teXt: [0, 0, 1000, 1000]\n\n[120, 160, 920, 840]\n\n[180, 330, 480, 630]\n\n1",
          "description": "",
