        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0049",
          "alias": "社区精选 049",
          "prompt": "<artist>\n0.6::artist:smilesmile1312,::,healthyman,fenrir (fenriluuu),,0.8::artist:kanzarin::,0.5::bacheally::,0.6::artist:sh_(shinh),0.8::shio (shiofeifei)::\n</artist>\n\n<style>\nyear 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,4::cute::\n</style>\n\n```xml\n<artwork>\n  <rendering_and_art_style>\n    Modern anime digital illustration style with clean, semi-soft lineart and cel-shaded rendering. Features smooth airbrushed color gradients on hair, soft ambient occlusion in fabric crevices, and crisp hard-edged rim highlights. Semi-painterly rendering for the distant environment and clouds.\n  </rendering_and_art_style>\n\n  <color_system>\n    <primary_palette>\n      <color name=\"Cape Crimson\" hex=\"#E84538\" role=\"Focal accent across mantle and boot soles\"/>\n      <color name=\"Wheat Blonde\" hex=\"#F5DE98\" role=\"Dominant hair and tail highlight tone\"/>\n      <color name=\"Atmospheric Sky Blue\" hex=\"#5EA4EB\" role=\"Primary background sky\"/>\n      <color name=\"Meadow Green\" hex=\"#98B848\" role=\"Foreground ground plane\"/>\n      <color name=\"Tactical Charcoal\" hex=\"#2B2929\" role=\"Vest, straps, and footwear upper\"/>\n    </primary_palette>\n    <lighting_tension>\n      Warm sunlit highlights (#FFF8DE) contrasted with cool atmospheric bounce and soft lavender-blue shaded undertones (#7D7CA6).\n    </lighting_tension>\n  </color_system>\n\n  <camera_and_composition bbox=\"[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\">\n    Eye-level to slight low-angle shot, vertically framed. The character is anchored centrally in a compact triangular squatting silhouette. Mid-telephoto focal compression with sharp character focus and softly graded depth-of-field blurring the distant mountain range and planetary curve.\n  </camera_and_composition>\n\n  <lighting_and_atmosphere>\n    Bright midday natural outdoor sunlight originating from the upper left. Strong key light casting crisp contact shadows beneath the knees and boots. Soft blue ambient fill from the open sky, subtle Fresnel rim highlights on hair edges, and floating loose green leaf particles adding air currents.\n  </lighting_and_atmosphere>\n\n  <character_and_anatomy bbox=\"[40, 31, 988, 990]\">\n    <identity>\n      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Canine/vulpine beastkin features including tall triangular animal ears with white inner fluff (#FBF1EB) and an oversized bushy tail (#E8B87A).\n    </identity>\n    \n    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox=\"[178, 526, 403, 765]\">\n      Delicate oval anime face, soft peach skin (#FEE5D4), subtle cheek blush. Slender eyebrows, relaxed closed-mouth gentle smirk. Large, warm golden-amber irises (#E08E2B to #F7D254) with sharp circular pupils and bright top catchlights, looking directly at the viewer.\n    </facial_structure_and_expression>\n\n    <hair_architecture>\n      Layered wheat-blonde hair (#F5DE98) with warm honey shadow tones (#D6AA5B). Choppy fringe framing the forehead, layered sidelocks cascading along the shoulders, and smooth angular tips styled outward.\n    </hair_architecture>\n\n    <pose_and_biomechanics>\n      Full crouching/squatting posture balanced over flexed knees and flat boot soles. Torso leaned forward, right elbow propped on the right knee with gloved fingers supporting the chin. Left arm extended downward, fingers loosely gripping a utility combat knife anchored toward the grass.\n    </pose_and_biomechanics>\n\n    <attire_and_materials>\n      <hooded_capelet bbox=\"[130, 335, 785, 792]\" hex=\"#E84538\">\n        Serrated-edge red hood draped over animal ears, detailed with black wing-like fin appliques and braided cords (#3D5AA6).\n      </hooded_capelet>\n      <tactical_tunic bbox=\"[460, 192, 880, 560]\" hex=\"#F2F4F7\">\n        White technical dress layered beneath a dark grey-black utility vest (#2B2929) fitted with cyan battery modules, pouches, clips, and hanging strap webbing.\n      </tactical_tunic>\n      <accessories_and_footwear bbox=\"[658, 386, 950, 725]\">\n        Black fingerless combat gloves (#2E2A2C). Heavy black mid-calf utility boots (#201E21) featuring buckled straps, white lacing, and thick treaded platform soles in vibrant red (#D93838).\n      </accessories_and_footwear>\n    </attire_and_materials>\n  </character_and_anatomy>\n\n  <environment_and_scenery>\n    Vibrant green alpine meadow foreground (#98B848) with small white wildflowers. Distant midground of rolling blue-grey mountain ridges and sci-fi facility spires. Background features a clear sky (#5EA4EB) filled with fluffy cumulus clouds and the faint silhouette of a massive celestial ringed planet.\n  </environment_and_scenery>\n</artwork>\n```, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text, teXt: Cape Crimson\n\n#E84538\n\nFocal accent across mantle and boot soles\n\nWheat Blonde\n\n#F5DE98\n\nDominant hair and tail highlight tone\n\nAtmospheric Sky Blue\n\n#5EA4EB\n\nPrimary background sky\n\nMeadow Green\n\n#98B848\n\nForeground ground plane\n\nTactical Charcoal\n\n#2B2929\n\nVest, straps, and footwear upper\n\n[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\n\n[40, 31, 988, 990]\n\n[178, 526, 403, 765]\n\n[130, 335, 785, 792]\n\n#E84538\n\n[460, 192, 880, 560]\n\n#F2F4F7\n\n[658, 386, 950, 725]",
