        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0052",
          "alias": "社区精选 052",
          "prompt": "<artist>\nartist:smilesmile1312,healthyman,fenrir (fenriluuu),,0.8::artist:kanzarin::,0.5::bacheally::,artist:sh_(shinh),shio (shiofeifei)\n</artist>\n\n<style>\nyear 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,4::cute::\n</style>\n\n```xml\n<artwork>\n  <rendering_and_art_style>\n    Japanese modern anime digital illustration with clean, warm-toned line art and delicate cel-shading combined with soft airbrushed lighting. Features vibrant bloom, soft ambient diffusion, and painterly environmental blending.\n  </rendering_and_art_style>\n\n  <color_system>\n    Dominant warm palette led by terracotta red (#B8523A) on the hood, warm blonde (#FBE7B5) hair, and amber gold (#ECA836) irises. Balanced by natural meadow greens (#9BB84D, #678635) and soft sun-bleached cream highlights (#FFFFE0). Shadows are tinted with subtle warm mauve and desaturated earthy tones (#6E5352).\n  </color_system>\n\n  <camera_and_composition bbox=\"[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\">\n    Close-up vertical portrait with a slightly high-angle perspective looking down at the character sitting on the grass. The composition uses a strong central focus, framed on the right by a textured tree trunk and in the foreground by soft-focus white wildflowers.\n  </camera_and_composition>\n\n  <lighting_and_atmosphere>\n    Bright midday dappled sunlight filtering through tree leaves (komorebi), casting bright specular spots (#FFFFE8) across the character's face, hair, and clothing. High-key bloom and Tyndall light scatter create a warm, cheerful, and airy outdoor atmosphere.\n  </lighting_and_atmosphere>\n\n  <character_and_anatomy bbox=\"[0, 50, 980, 950]\">\n    <identity>\n      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Features large, erect fox-like animal ears (#FBE7B5, interior white fluff #FFFFFF) poking through openings in her hooded cloak.\n    </identity>\n    \n    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox=\"[230, 230, 480, 640]\">\n      Youthful, rounded face with soft cheek blush (#F5A492). Large, luminous amber eyes (#ECA836) with distinct diamond-shaped pupils and bright white catchlights. Cheerful, open-mouthed smile (:D) displaying a small visible upper fang.\n    </facial_structure_and_expression>\n\n    <hair_architecture>\n      Pale warm blonde hair (#FBE7B5) parted in the center, featuring soft straight bangs across the forehead and two thick locks tied into low, rounded twintails (#EBD096) resting over her shoulders, secured with simple blue bands (#5475A8).\n    </hair_architecture>\n\n    <pose_and_biomechanics>\n      Sitting/kneeling forward on the grassy ground, leaning her upper body forward with straight arms extended downward, resting both hands in front of her atop a transparent utility board.\n    </pose_and_biomechanics>\n\n    <attire_and_materials>\n      Wears a prominent terracotta-red (#B8523A) hooded cape with geometric zigzag hems, fitted ear holes, and small black mechanical wing-like hairpins near the base of the right ear. Features tactical dark straps (#38302E) across the chest and waist, light-colored fingerless gloves (#DCD7CE) with thick cylindrical wrist cuffs (#8A8E85), and a pale skirt (#EFECE6).\n    </attire_and_materials>\n  </character_and_anatomy>\n\n  <environment_and_scenery>\n    A sun-drenched grassy knoll covered in vibrant green turf (#9BB84D) and clusters of small white blooming wildflowers (#FFFFFF). The right side is anchored by a vertical tree trunk, while the background dissolves into soft, bokeh-blurred forest foliage under direct sunlight.\n  </environment_and_scenery>\n</artwork>\n```, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text, teXt: [0, 0, 1000, 1000]\n\n[0, 50, 980, 950]\n\n[230, 230, 480, 640]",
