        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0053",
          "alias": "社区精选 053",
          "prompt": "<artist>\nartist:smilesmile1312,healthyman,fenrir (fenriluuu),0.8::artist:sh_(shinh),shio (shiofeifei)::,0.6::kanzarin::,0.6::bacheally::,takashima shoa\n</artist>\n\n<style>\nyear 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,cute,-1::no lineary::\n</style>\n\n```xml\n<artwork>\n  <rendering_and_art_style>\n    Clean digital anime illustration featuring sharp, dark purple-tinted dynamic line art with variable weighting. Vibrant cel-shading combined with crisp planar shadow casting, soft airbrushed specular bloom, and comic-style hatch marks along garment edges.\n  </rendering_and_art_style>\n\n  <color_system>\n    <dominant_palette>\n      <color name=\"Hooded Cape Primary\" hex=\"#E35875\" />\n      <color name=\"Cape Shadow Tone\" hex=\"#983353\" />\n      <color name=\"Gear &amp; Straps Slate Purple\" hex=\"#6B5D7A\" />\n      <color name=\"Hair Pale Blonde\" hex=\"#FFF1B5\" />\n      <color name=\"Iris Amber Gold\" hex=\"#FF9E1B\" />\n      <color name=\"Blade Steel Specular\" hex=\"#EAE8F2\" />\n      <color name=\"Neutral Studio Background\" hex=\"#CBC8CC\" />\n    </dominant_palette>\n    <chromatic_dynamic>\n      High-contrast palette balancing warm coral-crimson outerwear against cool slate-purple utility harnesses and a neutral studio grey background, accented by luminous yellow-orange eyes and polished metallic blade reflections.\n    </chromatic_dynamic>\n  </color_system>\n\n  <camera_and_composition bbox=\"[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\">\n    Close-up dynamic Dutch-angle portrait. The diagonal positioning of the broad tactical blade spans across the midground, slicing the frame from top-left to bottom-right. Focal emphasis is locked onto the intense gaze peering directly over the weapon's spine.\n  </camera_and_composition>\n\n  <lighting_and_atmosphere>\n    Strong front-overhead directional key light producing sharp, geometric shadow cutoffs cast by the jagged hood and the large blade. High-intensity specular sheen sweeps across the top edge of the blade, accompanied by soft warm subsurface bloom on the pale skin.\n  </lighting_and_atmosphere>\n\n  <character_and_anatomy bbox=\"[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\">\n    <identity>\n      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Lupo/wolf girl traits featuring large pointed canine ears protruding through custom hood apertures, dense white inner ear fluff, and a bushy blonde-tan tail visible at the lower right.\n    </identity>\n    \n    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox=\"[180, 380, 460, 780]\">\n      Compact anime jawline partially occluded by the weapon. Intense, focused forward gaze. Large stylized eyes with bright golden-amber irises (`#FF9E1B`), red-orange gradient depths (`#D65E12`), sharp dark eyelashes, and precise horizontal pupils.\n    </facial_structure_and_expression>\n\n    <hair_architecture>\n      Pale buttery blonde hair (`#FFF1B5`) with soft golden shading (`#E5B869`). Choppy straight-cut front bangs framing the eyes, with layered side locks and a small bundled ponytail tied at the front beneath the blade.\n    </hair_architecture>\n\n    <pose_and_biomechanics>\n      Dynamic defensive guard stance. Shoulders angled with both arms raised to present a heavy combat blade horizontally at mouth level, hands gripping the mechanical hilt and tactical fixtures.\n    </pose_and_biomechanics>\n\n    <attire_and_materials>\n      Voluminous coral-red hooded mantle (`#E35875`) with stylized jagged saw-tooth front edges and strap buckles. Underneath rests a pale dress shirt fitted with heavy industrial tactical webbing, purple-grey buckled harnesses (`#6B5D7A`), thigh straps, and segmented mechanical modules.\n    </attire_and_materials>\n  </character_and_anatomy>\n\n  <environment_and_scenery>\n    Solid minimalist flat grey background (`#CBC8CC`) providing clean graphic contrast, keeping full visual priority on the character's intricate silhouette, weapon mechanics, and saturated palette.\n  </environment_and_scenery>\n</artwork>\n```, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text, teXt: Hooded Cape Primary\n\n#E35875\n\nCape Shadow Tone\n\n#983353\n\nGear &amp; Straps Slate Purple\n\n#6B5D7A\n\nHair Pale Blonde\n\n#FFF1B5\n\nIris Amber Gold\n\n#FF9E1B\n\nBlade Steel Specular\n\n#EAE8F2\n\nNeutral Studio Background\n\n#CBC8CC\n\n[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\n\n[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\n\n[180, 380, 460, 780]",
