        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0059",
          "alias": "社区精选 059",
          "prompt": "<artist>\nartist:ruriri, healthyman,kele mimi,0::shio (shiofeifei),0::smilesmile1312,::,artist:sh_(shinh),artist:bacheally,\n</artist>\n\n<style>\nyear 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,detailed background,round face,2::cute,no lineart::, ultra-detailed,detailed background\n</style>\n\n```xml\n<artwork>\n  <rendering_and_art_style>\n    Clean modern anime digital illustration with semi-soft cel-shading and delicate warm-toned linework (#683A35). Smooth airbrush shading blended with sharp occlusion edges, soft painterly hair texture, and translucent skin rendering with subtle subsurface scattering.\n  </rendering_and_art_style>\n\n  <color_system>\n    <palette>\n      <color role=\"Hair and Fur\" hex=\"#F7D279\" secondary=\"#E8A94A\" shadow=\"#C47E3B\"/>\n      <color role=\"Iris\" hex=\"#F5B438\" highlight=\"#FFFFFF\" pupil=\"#FFFFFF\"/>\n      <color role=\"Skin\" hex=\"#FFF1EC\" blush=\"#F38C96\"/>\n      <color role=\"Attire - Shirt\" hex=\"#F9F6F7\" shadow=\"#D5CDD9\"/>\n      <color role=\"Attire - Shorts and Backpack\" hex=\"#B23543\" shadow=\"#7E1C27\"/>\n      <color role=\"Hosiery\" hex=\"#F6F2F5\" shadow=\"#D8CAD6\"/>\n      <color role=\"Background\" hex=\"#FFFFFF\"/>\n    </palette>\n    High-key lighting balance with warm golden-yellows, soft pink skin tones, and rich crimson accents contrasting against an unrendered white ground.\n  </color_system>\n\n  <camera_and_composition bbox=\"[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\">\n    Slightly high-angle three-quarter portrait, focusing on the character's seated posture and bashful expression. Vertical orientation centered on the torso and head, framed by large upright fox ears and a voluminous fluffy tail extending upward on the right.\n  </camera_and_composition>\n\n  <lighting_and_atmosphere>\n    Soft, diffused frontal-top key light (#FFFDF8) casting gentle downward shadows on the collarbones and clothing folds. Translucent rim lighting illuminating fine outer hair strands and ear tips, accompanied by soft atmospheric blush accents.\n  </lighting_and_atmosphere>\n\n  <character_and_anatomy bbox=\"[15, 10, 1000, 990]\">\n    <identity>\n      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Vulpo canine hybrid traits, featuring large upright fox ears with dense inner ear fluff (#E5DDD8) and an oversized bushy blonde fox tail raised behind her back.\n    </identity>\n    \n    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox=\"[130, 310, 470, 660]\">\n      Petite anime facial features with a small closed mouth, soft chin, and prominent diagonal blush lines (#F38C96) across both cheeks. Large, expressive amber-gold eyes (#F5B438) featuring bright white, diamond-shaped pupils and defined upper eyelashes. Direct gaze at the viewer with a bashful, flustered expression, accompanied by a small pink sketch-styled speech bubble to the left.\n    </facial_structure_and_expression>\n\n    <hair_architecture>\n      Warm golden-blonde hair (#F7D279) with soft bangs framing the forehead. Side strands styled into delicate braided loops draped across the front, transitioning into low loose bunches bound with pastel cyan (#5FB8D9) hair ties. Prominent flyaway strands catching the light.\n    </hair_architecture>\n\n    <pose_and_biomechanics>\n      Seated three-quarter stance angled toward the right while turning the head back toward the viewer. The right arm is raised with delicate bent fingers touching the base of the neck, and the torso displays a gentle forward curve with knees bent.\n    </pose_and_biomechanics>\n\n    <attire_and_materials>\n      Casual sportswear consisting of an oversized matte white cotton T-shirt (#F9F6F7) with soft creasing, red athletic gym shorts (#B23543) with white side stripes and a small logo, white thigh-high stockings (#F6F2F5) creating gentle skin indentations, and a structured red nylon rucksack (#B23543) worn over the shoulders.\n    </attire_and_materials>\n  </character_and_anatomy>\n\n  <environment_and_scenery>\n    Minimalist, pure white void background (#FFFFFF) with no environmental objects, focusing entirely on character silhouetting and color contrast.\n  </environment_and_scenery>\n</artwork>\n```\n, very aesthetic, amazing quality, no text, teXt: Hair and Fur\n\n#F7D279\n\n#E8A94A\n\n#C47E3B\n\nIris\n\n#F5B438\n\n#FFFFFF\n\n#FFFFFF\n\nSkin\n\n#FFF1EC\n\n#F38C96\n\nAttire - Shirt\n\n#F9F6F7\n\n#D5CDD9\n\nAttire - Shorts and Backpack\n\n#B23543\n\n#7E1C27\n\nHosiery\n\n#F6F2F5\n\n#D8CAD6\n\nBackground\n\n#FFFFFF\n\n[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\n\n[15, 10, 1000, 990]\n\n[130, 310, 470, 660]",
