        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0142",
          "alias": "社区精选 142",
          "prompt": "<artist>\nartist:smilesmile1312,healthyman,fenrir (fenriluuu),0.8::artist:sh_(shinh),shio (shiofeifei)::,0.6::kanzarin::,0.6::bacheally::,takashima shoa\n</artist>\n\n<style>\nyear 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,cute,-1::no lineary::\n</style>\n\n```xml\n<artwork>\n  <rendering_and_art_style>\n    Modern high-key anime digital illustration featuring clean, expressive linework tinted in warm reddish-brown tones. Uses soft cel-shading combined with delicate airbrushed gradients on the skin and hair, with crisp material rendering and minimal halftone textures against an isolated canvas.\n  </rendering_and_art_style>\n\n  <color_system>\n    <dominant_palette>\n      <color name=\"hair_base\" hex=\"#FDF1CA\"/>\n      <color name=\"vest_base\" hex=\"#9E7875\"/>\n      <color name=\"window_frame\" hex=\"#00A887\"/>\n      <color name=\"garment_white\" hex=\"#FBF6F0\"/>\n    </dominant_palette>\n    <secondary_accents>\n      <color name=\"beret_charcoal\" hex=\"#31343E\"/>\n      <color name=\"eye_amber\" hex=\"#EFA642\"/>\n      <color name=\"ribbon_orange\" hex=\"#E68B43\"/>\n      <color name=\"interior_shadow\" hex=\"#232026\"/>\n    </secondary_accents>\n    High-key exposure balancing warm cream and blonde tones against the vivid teal frame and dark interior contrast.\n  </color_system>\n\n  <camera_and_composition bbox=\"[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\">\n    Dynamic cowboy-shot crop framed along a diagonal axis. The subject leans outward through an emerald train window frame on the left, breaking the boundary toward the viewer against a stark white background.\n  </camera_and_composition>\n\n  <lighting_and_atmosphere>\n    Bright direct frontal key light (#FFF7EB) illuminating the character's face, hair, and torso. Deep ambient occlusion and cast shadows (#2A242B) inside the train cabin accentuate the depth as she pops out into the light.\n  </lighting_and_atmosphere>\n\n  <character_and_anatomy bbox=\"[48, 86, 960, 972]\">\n    <identity>\n      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Canine/wolf-girl traits including large, upright triangular ears with dense white inner fluff (#FFFFFF) and a large, bushy tail curling behind her.\n    </identity>\n    \n    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox=\"[178, 510, 395, 720]\">\n      Joyful open-mouthed expression showing upper teeth and tongue (#E87A7A). Wide, luminous amber eyes (#EFA642) with starry multi-layered highlights and delicate peach blush marks (#F8A499) on her cheeks.\n    </facial_structure_and_expression>\n\n    <hair_architecture>\n      Tousled medium-length pale blonde hair (#FDF1CA) with soft yellow highlights (#FFFBE8). Feathery bangs frame the forehead, while side locks are tied into small tufts with orange ribbons (#E68B43) below her prominent ears.\n    </hair_architecture>\n\n    <pose_and_biomechanics>\n      Dynamic forward lean through the window aperture; torso tilted at an angle with the right arm extending downward to grip the sill, while the left arm flexes upward with relaxed fingers near the cheek.\n    </pose_and_biomechanics>\n\n    <attire_and_materials>\n      Wears a dark charcoal beret (#31343E) with a large orange side bow (#E68B43). Layered outfit consists of a brown diamond-patterned argyle knit vest (#9E7875) over a loose white poet blouse (#FBF6F0) with ruffled cuffs, a dark sailor collar (#2B3A39), a white pleated skirt (#F5EFE6) with purple cross-lacing (#4A2C40), and a dark leather messenger bag strap (#42333E).\n    </attire_and_materials>\n  </character_and_anatomy>\n\n  <environment_and_scenery>\n    Mid-century commuter train window with a vibrant teal-green metal frame (#00A887) and clear glass upper transom panels. The cabin interior is plunged in deep shadow, isolated cleanly against a pure white background (#FFFFFF).\n  </environment_and_scenery>\n</artwork>\n```, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text, teXt: hair_base\n\n#FDF1CA\n\nvest_base\n\n#9E7875\n\nwindow_frame\n\n#00A887\n\ngarment_white\n\n#FBF6F0\n\nberet_charcoal\n\n#31343E\n\neye_amber\n\n#EFA642\n\nribbon_orange\n\n#E68B43\n\ninterior_shadow\n\n#232026\n\n[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\n\n[48, 86, 960, 972]\n\n[178, 510, 395, 720]",
          "description": "",
