        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0148",
          "alias": "社区精选 148",
          "prompt": "<artist>\nartist:ruriri, healthyman,kele mimi,0::shio (shiofeifei),0::smilesmile1312,::,artist:sh_(shinh),artist:bacheally,\n</artist>\n\n<style>\nyear 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,detailed background,round face,2::cute,no lineart::, ultra-detailed,detailed background\n</style>\n\n```xml\n<artwork>\n  <rendering_and_art_style>\n    Modern high-end anime digital illustration featuring clean line art tinted in soft warm browns (#7A5243). The shading method combines crisp cel-shaded shadow edges with subtle soft airbrushed gradients on skin and hair, rendered in a bright, sunlit aesthetic.\n  </rendering_and_art_style>\n\n  <color_system>\n    A bright summer coastal palette dominated by honey blonde (#E8B67C) and creamy white (#FAF8F8) in the foreground, contrasted against clear cerulean ocean blue (#5CA4CE) and pale sky blue (#B8D8F0). Warm peach skin tones (#FCE2D4) feature soft coral blush (#EE9485), balanced by sage green (#98B391) creature accents.\n  </color_system>\n\n  <camera_and_composition bbox=\"[0, 0, 1000, 1000]\">\n    Slight high-angle shot focused closely on the character kneeling in the center foreground. The vertical framing emphasizes the kneeling posture and direct eye contact, using a low horizon line to showcase the expansive open sea in the background.\n  </camera_and_composition>\n\n  <lighting_and_atmosphere>\n    Bright midday natural sunlight from the upper right, casting soft warm highlights (#FFF5E4) along the top of the hair, shoulders, and ears. Subtle diffuse bounce lighting reflects from the pale sand onto the lower limbs and torso.\n  </lighting_and_atmosphere>\n\n  <character_and_anatomy bbox=\"[20, 0, 955, 930]\">\n    <identity>\n      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Canine/Lupo characteristics including tall pointed animal ears with dense white interior fur (#F5EFEA) and a large, thick fluffy tail (#E5B177).\n    </identity>\n    \n    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox=\"[130, 400, 390, 680]\">\n      Heart-shaped face with a confident, open-mouthed smile. Warm amber-orange irises (#C97E3B) with dark pupils and bright white diamond/star catchlights visible through strands of hair, complemented by a soft flush across the cheeks and nose bridge.\n    </facial_structure_and_expression>\n\n    <hair_architecture>\n      Short, voluminous honey-blonde hair (#E8B67C) styled into two small low pigtails tied with silver ring clips (#A4A8B0). Straight layered bangs frame the forehead with small crown braids on both sides.\n    </hair_architecture>\n\n    <pose_and_biomechanics>\n      Kneeling on both knees on the beach sand, leaning forward with arms extended downward and fingertips lightly resting on the ground, creating a forward-tilted upper body posture.\n    </pose_and_biomechanics>\n\n    <attire_and_materials>\n      A clean white one-piece swimsuit (#FAF8F8) featuring an off-the-shoulder elastic neckline with an accordion-ruffle band, adorned with a small red insignia badge (#D34338) on the left chest.\n    </attire_and_materials>\n  </character_and_anatomy>\n\n  <environment_and_scenery>\n    A sunny tropical beach midground with shallow turquoise waters and gentle white foam lapping against smooth, wet sand (#D8C2AF). A plump, stylized sage-green frog mascot (#98B391) stands partially submerged beside the character under a bright, softly clouded summer sky.\n  </environment_and_scenery>\n</artwork>\n```, very aesthetic, amazing quality, no text, teXt: [0, 0, 1000, 1000]\n\n[20, 0, 955, 930]\n\n[130, 400, 390, 680]",
