        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0165",
          "alias": "社区精选 165",
          "prompt": "A highly detailed 3D animated style digital illustration of a furry, anthropomorphic bipedal cow or bull character standing in the center of the frame. The character is completely devoid of clothes, its body instead entirely covered in thick, bright, textured golden-yellow fur. It features a large, smooth, prominent light purple or lavender muzzle with human-like closed lips forming a faint, knowing, and subtly smug smirk. On top of its head are two short, dark grey horns curving gently inwards and upwards, alongside small animal ears with light pink interiors. The facial expression is highly expressive and humanized, featuring relaxed, slightly raised thin black eyebrows and half-closed eyes with heavy eyelids, conveying a deeply chill, unbothered, and intensely smug gaze directed straightforwardly at the viewer. The figure is framed from the chest up in a relaxed, upright standing pose, with its body angled slightly to the left while its head turns back to face the camera directly. The background is a vibrant golden hour landscape, featuring a deeply saturated sunset sky glowing with warm orange, yellow, and soft peach hues mixed with hazy, gently glowing clouds. Behind the character, framing the lower left and right sides of the image, are jagged, uneven rocky terrains and mountains that are heavily shaded in deep blue and purple tones due to the dramatic backlighting of the setting sun. Protruding from the rocky slope on the left side is a single, highly stylized green tree made up of distinctive, stacked spherical clusters of pine-like foliage., very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text",
