        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0211",
          "alias": "社区精选 211",
          "prompt": "<artist>\n0.7::urotsuki (ku9625)::,healthyman:year 2026,0.5::kanzarin:year 2026,::,kele mimi,0.8::takashima shoa:year 2026,::,0.7::na tarapisu153, ::artist:bacheally\n</artist>\ny\n<style>\nyear 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,detailed background,round face, ultra-detailed,detailed background,ultra complexity\n</style>\n\nAn anime digital illustration rendered with crisp clean lineart, soft cel-shading that melts into gentle airbrushed gradients, and a luminous painterly finish over a clean white backdrop. The composition is a vertical portrait framed around a single petite figure, a young feline vampire girl with the delicate childlike proportions of a loli, seated and turned toward the viewer in a relaxed, affectionate pose. Her body is angled three-quarters while her face tilts up to meet the camera at eye level, creating an intimate and engaging connection.\n\nHer skin is fair and smooth with a soft peachy warmth, and a delicate flush of rosy pink spreads across her cheeks and the bridge of her nose. Her expression is a tender closed-lip smile that curves gently at the corners, and at the edge of that smile two tiny pointed fangs peek from between her lips, a subtle whisper of her vampire nature. Her eyes are large, round, and striking, glowing with a vibrant crimson red that holds deep starry reflections, tiny specks of light scattered across the iris like a night sky, framed by soft dark lashes and a faint highlight dot that makes them glisten. The collarbones are softly visible just beneath the loose neckline, and a gentle indentation of skin shows where her arm presses against her torso.\n\nOn top of her head sit a pair of delicate feline ears, rounded and pointed, colored in cool ice-blue and white with soft inner shading, angled as if attuned to the room. Her hair is a long flowing cascade of pale ice-blue, slightly disheveled and tousled, drifting in loose waves past her shoulders and down her back, with fine wispy bangs falling across her forehead and a few stray flyaway strands catching the light around her cheeks. The hair carries a cool almost translucent sheen with brighter silver-blue highlights along the crown.\n\nShe rests her chin on her hands, both fists loosely closed and forearms propped upright, elbows settled against her raised legs, conveying a sense of cozy anticipation. One knee is lifted high toward the foreground, the bare thigh broad and smooth with a soft specular sheen, while the other leg tucks beneath her, the white sock just visible at the ankle. Her posture is compact and youthful, the small frame balanced with easy grace.\n\nHer outfit is a loose white short-sleeved top with deep crimson trim ringing the collar and the cuffs, the fabric draping softly with relaxed tension folds across the chest and sleeves, the hem resting over her waist. Below she wears dark navy shorts that fall high on the thigh, the matte cotton fabric gathering in gentle folds, marked on one hip with a small stylized white emblem. A black ribbon choker is tied neatly around her throat, finished with a tiny metallic bell that catches a glint of light.\n\nBehind her, the plain white space is decorated with elegant musical motifs, a sweeping arc of golden-yellow staves with small note heads curving around her form, a bold red treble clef rising in the upper right, and a softer sky-blue treble clef floating at the lower left, all rendered as clean flat graphic shapes that frame the figure without cluttering it.\n\nThe lighting is bright and even, a soft frontal key light that keeps the shadows gentle and the skin glowing, with subtle rim highlights tracing the edges of her hair, ears, and the raised thigh. The overall mood is warm, sweet, and quietly whimsical, the decorative notes lending a musical and playful atmosphere to the portrait., very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text",
