        {
          "id": "codex-nai5_community_pack_mengshen_0213",
          "alias": "社区精选 213",
          "prompt": "<artist>\n0.7::urotsuki (ku9625)::,healthyman:year 2026,0.5::kanzarin:year 2026,::,kele mimi,0.8::takashima shoa:year 2026,::,0.7::na tarapisu153, ::artist:bacheally\n</artist>\n\n<style>\nyear 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,detailed background,round face, ultra-detailed,detailed background,ultra complexity\n</style>\n\nAn anime digital illustration rendered with crisp clean lineart, smooth cel-shading, and softly blended color gradients, set against a seamless plain white studio background that isolates the figure in calm, neutral light. The central subject is a young girl with a delicate, slightly drowsy expression, leaning her upper body gently forward toward the viewer in a relaxed, half-lowered stance framed as a cowboy shot from the mid-thigh upward. Her gaze meets the lens through half-lidded eyes of warm luminescent yellow, the irises catching a soft pinpoint highlight, framed by long dark lashes and a faint flush of dusty rose across her cheeks and the bridge of her nose. Her small lips are parted in a quiet, almost dazed pout, and a hint of collarbone shows at the opening of her collar.\n\nHer hair is strikingly white and extremely long, falling in smooth glossy sheets far past her waist with a cool pale-blue shadow tone in the depths and bright silvery highlights along the crest of each lock. A single thick side braid is woven over one shoulder, its rounded coils catching the light, while fine wispy strands and a few flyaways soften the silhouette around her face. A soft curtain of bangs is parted in the center with a delicate strand falling directly between her eyes, and longer side locks frame both cheeks. On the crown of her head sit two large mismatched ribbons, one in deep matte black and the other in bright tangerine orange, their stiff folded wings spreading outward. Tucked beside one bow is a small feather hair ornament composed of slender jet-black feathers fanning upward.\n\nAt the neckline, a structured stand-up collar rises neatly, anchored at the center of the chest by a small orange diamond-shaped brooch with a faceted gleam. A narrow orange neck ribbon is knotted at the throat, its two long flat ends trailing down over the bodice. Draped over the shoulders is a short black capelet edged with a crisp white frill trim, the frills catching a thin rim of light along their scalloped edge. Beneath it she wears a black dress with long, generously puffy sleeves that gather into fitted cuffs past the wrists, the fabric showing soft tension folds at the elbows and hips. The skirt is deliberately asymmetrical, with a one-sided orange overskirt sweeping across one side over an underlying white pleated layer, the sharp pleats fanning out in even geometric ridges. Along the front, criss-cross lace-up straps cross over one another in a neat X-pattern, and a black bow is tied at the waist. The hem is finished with multiple layers of frilled ruffles that part to reveal a soft grey petticoat tucked beneath. Her legs are sheathed in fine grey pantyhose, and her feet are in glossy black mary jane shoes secured with a thin ankle strap.\n\nOne arm is bent with the hand resting casually on the hip, pushing the hip out slightly, while the other arm falls loosely forward, the posture giving a slouching, endearingly tired air. The lighting is soft and even, a gentle frontal key light that models the roundness of the face and the volume of the hair, paired with a subtle cool rim glow tracing the outer edges of the white locks and the frilled capelet, all under a clean, low-contrast studio atmosphere with faint bloom and no harsh shadows., very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text",
