          "prompt": "close-up portrait from a slightly low angle, subject partially framed by lush green leaves in the foreground; rendered on cold-pressed watercolor paper with highly visible paper fibers and subtle pigment granulation—leaves show soft washes with gentle bleeding, faint pencil underdrawing peeking through translucent layers, and tiny graphite smudges along stem edges; dewdrops are luminous halos with soft watercolor bloom, not crisp reflections; hair strands outlined in fine brush ink with slight irregularity, mimicking hand-drawn line variation, and subtly diffused at tips like wet pigment; composition uses generous negative space around the eye, background softly blurred in aged paper beige and muted sage tones; overall aesthetic: a tactile hand-drawn studio illustration—cel-shading structure preserved beneath delicate watercolor washes, visible paper grain at macro scale, gentle imperfections (slight edge fraying, faint crease marks), evoking a cherished sketchbook page from a healing-art illustrator. 4k resolution, no digital perfection, all details emphasize physical medium authenticity., best quality, amazing quality, very aesthetic, absurdres, masterpiece, highres, newest, high detail",
