ed robe leans forward, resting her face in her hands with her eyes closed, completely absorbed in the melody. They are organically framed by an archway of lush green trees with delicate pink petals gently drifting down around them. The warm, dappled sunlight illuminates the characters against a softly blurred background of a classic fantasy European town, creating a cinematic, epic storybook atmosphere.",
