          "alias": "社区精选 370",
          "prompt": "0.6:: artist:min_(120716),0.2:: kaiaik (zheliakaina),0.4:: rolua,0.8:: nueegochi,0.9:: yoneyama_mai,0.7:: sixii, star (symbol,year 2025,3:: clean linert,::stunning composition,2::limited palette, ::,\n-1::simple background::\n-3::highly finished,city,text ::\n-5::Smooth lines,messy background,::\n2::Messy draft::\n2::messy lines,8::best quality, absurdres, very aesthetic, detailed, masterpiece::,\n\n\n                                                                                                                           ,ray(arknights), sunglasses on head, open white shirt, translucent shirt, black tank top, crop top, denim shorts, ripped shorts, polish, casual wear, summer clothes\ncalm, relaxed, looking at viewer, slight blush, peaceful face, lazy expression\nsitting straight, sitting on chair, good posture, holding plastic cup, holding drink, drinking, drinking through straw, straw in mouth, both hands on cup, relaxed posture\noutdoor cafe, wooden table, glass window, window reflection, hanging plants, green leaves, falling leaf, city street, bright day, summer, cozy atmosphere\ndappled sunlight, soft lighting, rim light, lens flare, bright atmosphere, depth of field, masterpiece, best quality, ultra detailed, anime illustration, art by yoneyama mai\nstraight on, medium shot, eye level, waist up\nblue and green theme, bright colors, warm lighting, summer palette\nA highly detailed illustration of a girl sitting perfectly straight on a chair at a charming outdoor cafe on a bright summer day. She is placed slightly to the right of the center, gracefully holding a cold summer drink with both hands and sipping through a straw. The scene is beautifully framed by lush hanging green leaves at the top and a blue-tinted glass window behind her. The lighting features stunning dappled sunlight filtering through the foliage, creating a relaxed, cozy, and highly cinematic atmosphere with crisp details, vivid textures, and a refreshing summer aesthetic."