          "prompt": "0.6:: artist:min_(120716),0.2:: kaiaik (zheliakaina),0.4:: rolua,0.8:: nueegochi,0.9:: yoneyama_mai,0.7:: sixii,::,year 2025,3:: clean linert,::stunning composition,2::limited palette, ::,\n-1::simple background::\n-3::highly finished,city,text ::\ncolor trace,water_pastel_color,::stunning composition,limited palette,\n2::messy lines,8::best quality, absurdres, very aesthetic, detailed, masterpiece::,\n\n\n                                                                                                                            ,masterpiece, best quality, sketch, lineart, high contrast, arknights, 1boy, solo,Executor the Ex Foedere (arknights), solo focus, multiple others, faceless males, armed crowd\ntactical clothes, red jacket, white coat, straps, heavy jacket, winter clothes\nexpressionless, blank stare, stoic, calm, empty eyes, unflinching, unbothered, staring at viewer\nhands up, raised hands, surrender pose, showing palms, giving up, surrounded, enemies aiming guns, gun pointed at character, multiple guns, imminent danger, hostage\ndark alleyway, ruined street, warzone, battlefield, rain, falling rain, blurred background, urban ruins\ncinematic lighting, dramatic shadows, harsh lighting, rim light, depth of field, sharp focus on character, foreground blur, depth of field, chiaroscuro, masterpiece, best quality, ultra detailed, cinematic visuals, zack snyder style, art by yoneyama mai\nupper body, medium shot, straight on, eye level, front view\ndark theme, black and red theme, desaturated background, high contrast\nA highly tense and cinematic medium shot focusing on the upper body of a girl surrounded by numerous enemies. Countless gun barrels from both the blurred foreground and the dark background are pointed directly at her from all directions. Despite the overwhelming threat, she remains completely expressionless and stoic, calmly raising both hands in a classic surrender pose. The camera is positioned straight on at eye level, utilizing a shallow depth of field to blur the threatening weapons while keeping her unflinching reaction in sharp focus. The scene features harsh, dramatic shadows and cinematic rim lighting, creating a thrilling and suffocating atmosphere of a gritty war movie.",
