              "character_prompts": [
                {
                  "label": "char1",
                  "prompt": "A wide horizontal panel at the top of the page.\nTwo girls facing each other in a flower field at sunset. \nLeft girl: Sakuraba Emma, short pink hair with ahoge, pink eyes, wearing official magical girl outfit — white bodice with pink frills, short flared skirt, chest ribbon, fingerless gloves, thigh-high socks. \nRight girl: Nikaidou Hiro, black long hair in a high ponytail, dark blue eyes, wearing official magical girl outfit — dark blue high-collar jacket, black short skirt, white cravat, black gloves.\nThey hold both hands, smiling at each other with bittersweet warmth. Soft golden sunset light, flower petals blowing in the wind, gentle nostalgic atmosphere.\nSpeech bubble from Emma: \"我们已经……和好了吧？\"\nSpeech bubble from Hiro: \"嗯，这次我会一直陪着你。\"",
                  "negative": "lowres, aliasing,"
                },
                {
                  "label": "char2",
                  "prompt": "A small square panel, placed below the top panel on the left side.\nInside a dim hotel room at night. \nSakuraba Emma, pink hair, pink eyes, wearing a simple white nightgown, sitting alone on the edge of the bed, hugging her knees.\nShe stares at her phone screen, the pale blue glow illuminating her sad face. A single tear slides down her cheek.\nDark room, muted colors, vulnerable lonely mood.\nSpeech bubble from Emma: \"明明她已经在我身边了……为什么我还是这么寂寞……\"",
                  "negative": "lowres, aliasing,"
                },
